00854dd0 probe A3-1 toy: what makes `range + physics->GetRadius()` emit fld range; fadd [p+34h]? -> only an lvalue radius (direct member or const float& getter); every by-value inline getter / local / cast / flag (/Op /O1 /G7 /Oa /Ow) gives fld [p+34h] first; sum into a named variable gives retail order but spills (mov/push)
00854dd0 probe A3-2 toy: what builds the subtraction X-first with only Z homed (`fst z; fmul z`)? -> only a NON-address-taken vector (diff, or direction when the hit gets a copy); `C3DVector diff = a-b; C3DVector direction = diff; direction.Normalise();` reproduces retail's whole x87 sequence (fstp f; fxch st1; fmul f ...) but diff gets its own slot (frame +8)
